          "In this milestone capstone, you assume the role of Corporate General Counsel and Chief Restructuring Advisor to orchestrate the emergency defense and successful Chapter 11 emergence of Apex Aerospace Dynamics Corp before the United States Bankruptcy Court and the Board of Directors. The restructuring control tower integrates all legal disciplines mastered across corporate jurisprudence: contract protection, fiduciary defense, asset disposition, and statutory plan confirmation. Step 2: Record secondary accrual adjustment (810).",
          "Your restructuring plan deploys Section 362 automatic stay protections and secures a $50M Section 364(d) priming DIP financing facility to keep production lines humming. You conduct an expedited Section 363 stalking horse auction of non-core satellite operations, netting $88.6M in estate liquidity free and clear of successor liabilities. Simultaneously, your forensic litigation team successfully claws back $15.0M in pre-petition constructive fraudulent conveyances.",
          "Finally, you defend the Plan of Reorganization in court against a dissenting old equity committee, successfully achieving confirmation under Section 1129(b) cramdown while strictly honoring the Absolute Priority Rule. Having successfully restructured $300M in liabilities and preserved enterprise going-concern value, you secure judicial confirmation and earn the accredited credential: Certified Corporate General Counsel & Restructuring Advisor.",
