      "example": "An industrial conglomerate with five hundred crore net worth reports PBT of one hundred and fifty crore rupees, which includes fifty crore in extraordinary real estate capital gains. The engine removes the capital gain, establishing true Section 198 profit of one hundred crore rupees. Across the three-year base, average profit is ninety crore, generating a mandatory two percent CSR spend of one point eight crore rupees. The company applies sixty lakhs in carried-forward excess credits, resulting in an audited net spending obligation of one point two crore rupees.",
      "code": "def capstone_audit_committee_and_csr_simulator(audit_members, audit_ind_count, all_financially_literate, pbt_history, capital_gains_history, prior_excess_csr_cr, actual_csr_spent_cr):\n    # 1. Audit Committee Constitution Invariant\n    size_ok = audit_members >= 3\n    ind_majority = audit_ind_count > (audit_members / 2.0)\n    audit_committee_valid = size_ok and ind_majority and all_financially_literate\n    \n    if not audit_committee_valid:\n        return {\"audit_committee_valid\": False, \"status\": \"AUDIT_COMMITTEE_DEFECTIVE\"}\n        \n    # 2. Section 198 Net Profit Calculation (PBT minus Capital Gains)\n    sec_198_profits = []\n    for pbt, cap_gain in zip(pbt_history, capital_gains_history):\n        sec_198 = max(0.0, pbt - cap_gain)\n        sec_198_profits.append(sec_198)\n        \n    avg_3yr_profit = sum(sec_198_profits) / len(sec_198_profits)\n    gross_csr_mandate = 0.02 * avg_3yr_profit\n    \n    # 3. Apply excess setoff from prior years (Section 135(5) 3rd proviso)\n    setoff_applied = min(prior_excess_csr_cr, gross_csr_mandate)\n    net_csr_obligation = gross_csr_mandate - setoff_applied\n    \n    # 4. Evaluate actual expenditure\n    if actual_csr_spent_cr >= net_csr_obligation:\n        new_excess = actual_csr_spent_cr - net_csr_obligation\n        shortfall = 0.0\n        csr_status = \"COMPLIANT_SURPLUS\" if new_excess > 0 else \"COMPLIANT_EXACT\"\n    else:\n        new_excess = 0.0\n        shortfall = net_csr_obligation - actual_csr_spent_cr\n        csr_status = \"NON_COMPLIANT_SHORTFALL\"\n        \n    return {\n        \"audit_committee_valid\": True,\n        \"avg_sec_198_profit_cr\": avg_3yr_profit,\n        \"gross_csr_mandate_cr\": gross_csr_mandate,\n        \"setoff_applied_cr\": setoff_applied,\n        \"net_csr_obligation_cr\": net_csr_obligation,\n        \"actual_spent_cr\": actual_csr_spent_cr,\n        \"new_excess_cr\": new_excess,\n        \"shortfall_cr\": shortfall,\n        \"csr_status\": csr_status\n    }\n\n# Run simulation: 4 members (3 ind), PBT history [110, 130, 150], capital gains [20, 30, 50] -> 198 profits [90, 100, 100] -> avg 96.67 Cr\nres = capstone_audit_committee_and_csr_simulator(\n    audit_members=4,\n    audit_ind_count=3,\n    all_financially_literate=True,\n    pbt_history=[110.0, 130.0, 150.0],\n    capital_gains_history=[20.0, 30.0, 50.0],\n    prior_excess_csr_cr=0.50,\n    actual_csr_spent_cr=1.60\n)\nprint(\"Audit Committee Lawfully Constituted:\", res[\"audit_committee_valid\"])\nprint(f\"Three-Year Avg Section 198 Profit: {res['avg_sec_198_profit_cr']:.2f} Cr\")\nprint(f\"Gross 2% CSR Mandate: {res['gross_csr_mandate_cr']:.2f} Cr\")\nprint(f\"Set-Off Credit Applied: {res['setoff_applied_cr']:.2f} Cr\")\nprint(f\"Net CSR Obligation: {res['net_csr_obligation_cr']:.2f} Cr\")\nprint(\"CSR Compliance Status:\", res[\"csr_status\"])\n",
      "output": "Audit Committee Lawfully Constituted: True\nThree-Year Avg Section 198 Profit: 96.67 Cr\nGross 2% CSR Mandate: 1.93 Cr\nSet-Off Credit Applied: 0.50 Cr\nNet CSR Obligation: 1.43 Cr\nCSR Compliance Status: COMPLIANT_SURPLUS\n",
