      example: "In practice, when implementing Sovereign Immunity, Foreign Asset Attachment & Arbitral Execution Simulator, an engineering or financial team first captures Sovereign and validates Immunity against Foreign before committing Asset. Under the restrictive theory of sovereign immunity, property used for commercial activity (acta jure gestionis) is subject to execution, whereas diplomatic and military properties (acta jure imperii) are protected by absolute immunity. (Stage 3: Apply Board governance oversight and compliance controls.)",
